---
import RulePage from "../components/RulePage.astro";
import { HEADSHOT_URL, MAIN_SITE, REPO_URL } from "../lib/brand";
---

<RulePage
  slug="whats-next"
  description="I hope you found value in these skills. They are evolving, so if you want to keep up to date, you need to subscribe. Paid subscribers are loved even more."
  subtitle=""
  lead=""
>
  <p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-relaxed text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50">
    I hope you found value in these skills. They are evolving, so if you want to keep up to date, you need to
    <a href={`${MAIN_SITE}/subscribe`} class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4">subscribe</a>.
    <a href="https://members.stephansmith.me/upgrade" class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4">Paid subscribers</a>
    are loved even more.
  </p>
  <section class="mt-10 flex items-start gap-6 sm:gap-8" aria-label="About Stephan">
    <img
      src={HEADSHOT_URL}
      alt="Stephan Smith"
      width="160"
      height="160"
      class="h-32 w-32 shrink-0 rounded-xl object-cover ring-1 ring-neutral-200 sm:h-40 sm:w-40 dark:ring-neutral-700"
    />
    <div class="max-w-xl">
      <p class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-50">
        I'm Stephan
      </p>
      <p class="mt-0.5 text-lg text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
        Tech Transactions and fractional CTO
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
        I work across teams and projects. I review what people build with AI, and I help them get it out the door.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <ul class="mt-10 divide-y divide-neutral-200 border-t border-neutral-200 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-900 dark:divide-neutral-800 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-50">
    <li class="py-4 pr-12 sm:pr-16">
      You can
      <a href={`${MAIN_SITE}/subscribe`} class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4">subscribe</a>
      to my newsletter for my weekly updates.
    </li>
    <li class="py-4 pr-12 sm:pr-16">
      You can
      <a href="https://members.stephansmith.me/upgrade" class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4">upgrade</a>
      for access to my MCP. It gives the rules a little bit more power.
    </li>
    <li class="py-4 pr-12 sm:pr-16">
      You can go over to
      <a href={REPO_URL} class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4">this repository</a>
      and like it on
      <a href={REPO_URL} class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium underline underline-offset-4">
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path
            d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"
          ></path>
        </svg>
        GitHub
      </a>.
    </li>
    <li class="py-4 pr-12 sm:pr-16">
      You can get
      <a href={`${MAIN_SITE}/services/sponsor-review`} class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4">sponsorship information</a>.
    </li>
    <li class="py-4 pr-12 sm:pr-16">
      You can
      <a href="https://book.stephansmith.me" class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4">book time with me</a>
      and see whether or not a deeper engagement makes sense.
    </li>
    <li class="py-4 pr-12 sm:pr-16">
      You can
      <a href="mailto:stephan@stephansmith.me?subject=A%20skill%20to%20build" class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4">suggest a skill</a>
      that you want built out or matured.
    </li>
    <li class="py-4 pr-12 sm:pr-16">
      <a href={REPO_URL} class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4">This repo</a>
      and all the code are completely open source and public. Pull the repo and submit a
      <a href={`${REPO_URL}/pulls`} class="font-medium underline underline-offset-4">pull request</a>
      if you want to change or modify a skill. I 100% would love some help.
    </li>
  </ul>
</RulePage>
